  <title>Fiscal years</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Administration</gui><gui>Fiscal years</gui></guiseq> lists
  the fiscal years. Reports such as <link xref="profit_loss_report"/> and
  budgets, inventory counts and the trial balance use them.</p>

  <steps>
    <item><p>Type the new year's <gui>Name</gui>, and choose its <gui>Start
    date</gui> and <gui>End date</gui> with the icons.</p></item>
    <item><p>Click <gui>Create new fiscal year</gui>, and confirm. A fiscal
    year cannot be cancelled or have its dates changed afterwards, so check
    them first.</p></item>
  </steps>

  <p>Click a year's name to rename it. Uncheck <gui>Active</gui> to close a
  year once its books are final: payments in a closed year can no longer be
  changed in <link xref="payments_received"/>.</p>

</page>
